<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BRL Hardy half year net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BRL Hardy half year net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.33 vs 11.04</p>
<p>    Net				     10.64 vs 7.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     4.50 vs 4.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  134.62 vs 124.74</p>
<p>    Other income			  10.98 vs 1.24</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.13 vs 6.64</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 3.10 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					5.79 vs 4.02</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.31 vs 3.25</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.17 vs 4.05</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date October 21</p>
<p>Reg date October 8</p>
<p>NOTE: BRL Hardy Ltd is a vintner.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
